# Butler Routes - Thousand Needles (Horde) completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist).
# Every Horde-accepting Thousand Needles quest in the local census (26 quests,
# docs/thousand-needles-horde-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept;
# all 26 turn in (4 at expedition enders outside the zone). Shared and neutral
# quests stay in the main thousand-needles.guide (ungated this round) and are
# NOT duplicated here. Chain order is strictly turn-in-before-accept; pres
# accepting outside the contract ride as pre-notes (their quests are Horde
# but belong to Orgrimmar, Mulgore or the Barrens). Objectives ride complete
# / collect lines at data-placed points; the four totem kinds of Storm, Earth,
# and Fire drop only outside the zone, so each rides an expedition leg grouped
# by destination. Coordinates use the era frame; expedition stops switch zone
# map frames and switch back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/thousand-needles-horde
title Thousand Needles (Horde)
levels 20-32
zone Thousand Needles
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords thousand needles, horde, completionist, freewind, whitereach
coords live
version 1

step Freewind Post - arrival

  tip Moktar Krin (67.58, 63.94) runs Freewind Post; Jandia (46.21, 51.51), Dorn Plainstalker (53.95, 41.49), Rau Cliffrunner (46.14, 51.71) and Prate Cloudseer (53.54, 42.65) stand the post. The west and the silithid south fill below.
  note 1147's pre (1146 The Swarm Grows, an Orgrimmar quest from Belgrom Rockmaul) fills outside this route - take 1147 here.
  accept 1147 -- The Swarm Grows - Moktar Krin; silithid searchers, invaders and hive drones, far south
  note 1197's pre (1196 The Sacred Flame, a Mulgore quest from Zangen Stonehoof) fills outside this route - take 1197 here.
  accept 1197 -- The Sacred Flame - Rau Cliffrunner; a Cloven Hoof, west
  note 79360's pres (the Call of Air links 1531/1532/96136, Orgrimmar and Mulgore shaman calls) fill outside this route - take 79360 here.
  accept 79360 only Shaman -- Elemental Aid - Prate Cloudseer; a Tattered Note, carried in
  note 79360's Tattered Note (item 274463) has no placed source anywhere in the data - have it in your bags.
  complete 79360 only Shaman
  accept 98069 -- Stolen Freewind Supplies - Jandia; eight stolen supplies, carried in
  note The Stolen Freewind Supplies (item 279383) have no placed source anywhere in the data (their crate object 670338 is not in the data) - have eight in your bags.
  complete 98069
  accept 98070 -- Stop the Screeching - Jandia; screeching harpies, north

