  note Rok'Alim the Pounder (level 30) works the far west - take the Fragments there.
  turnin 1151 -- Test of Strength - the Fragments to Dorn Plainstalker
  accept 1152 -- Test of Lore - Dorn Plainstalker; Braug Dimspirit takes it in Stonetalon, west

