step Silithid south - the swarm

  complete 1147 @67.72,83.51 era -- five Silithid Searchers for Moktar Krin
  complete 1147 @63.51,85.8 era -- five Silithid Invaders for Moktar Krin
  complete 1147 @63.51,85.8 era -- five Silithid Hive Drones for Moktar Krin
  note The silithids swarm the far south around (63-72, 81-89) - work the hives for all fifteen.
  note The Cracked Silithid Carapace (item 5877) drops off the southern silithids - it starts Parts of the Swarm in your bags.
  collect 5877 optional @67.72,83.51 era -- the Cracked Silithid Carapace, starting Parts of the Swarm
  note 1148's pre (1146 The Swarm Grows, an Orgrimmar quest from Belgrom Rockmaul) fills outside this route - take 1148 here.
  accept 1148 -- Parts of the Swarm - the Carapace; the Heart, Talons and Carapaces, south
  collect 5855 @67.72,83.51 era -- the Silithid Heart for Korran
  collect 5854 x5 @67.72,83.51 era -- Silithid Talons for Korran
  collect 5853 x3 @67.72,83.51 era -- Intact Silithid Carapaces for Korran
  note The Heart, Talons and Carapaces all drop off the southern silithids - Korran takes them in the Barrens, on the leg below; 1184 continues there, not here.

step Freewind Post - the shaman chain

  turnin 79360 only Shaman -- Elemental Aid - the Note to Rau Cliffrunner
  accept 79364 only Shaman -- Eyes on the Sky - Rau Cliffrunner; Prate takes it, east
  turnin 79364 only Shaman -- Eyes on the Sky - back to Prate Cloudseer
  accept 79361 only Shaman -- Storm, Earth, and Fire - Prate Cloudseer; twenty Twisted Totems, four far zones
  note The Twisted Totems drop nowhere in Thousand Needles in the data - Water off the Barrens and Dustwallow mirefins, Earth off the Swamp of Sorrows Lost Ones, Fire off the Badlands ogres, Air off the Desolace maraudine. Each rides its expedition leg below; the turn-in waits until all twenty are in hand.

